&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td colspan="3" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;労働者の男女の賃金の差異(％)&lt;/p&gt;
