  <jpcrp_cor:OverviewOfBusinessAllianceDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row6Member">当社グループの主要な借入先であり、また多岐に渡る取引があります。</jpcrp_cor:OverviewOfBusinessAllianceDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
